<title>USA: Teledata wins $5 mln Brazil order.</title>
<headline>Teledata wins $5 mln Brazil order.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teledata Communications Ltd said Monday it received a $5 million order for its new DCS-20E system from a Brazilian telecommunications operator.</p>
<p>The company said deliveries will begin in the second quarter and will continue for several months after the initial delivery.</p>
<p>The DCS-20E is the new generation of the DCS-20 concentrating multiplexer system. Teledata makes wireline and wireless customer access network equipment for telephone operating companies.</p>
</text>
